      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bbuchfink/diamond/tarball/v2.2.6",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bbuchfink/diamond/zipball/v2.2.6",
      "body": "- Improved the performance of the search and clustering workflows.\r\n- Improved the sensitivity of the `--very-sensitive` alignment mode.\r\n- Fixed potential issues of increased memory use in the clustering workflows.\r\n- Added the option `--linclust-minichunk` to set the minimal chunk size for linear-time clustering rounds.\r\n- Added limited support for the AVX512 machine instructions and the respective runtime dispatch code.\r\n- The SSE4.1 compatible architecture code path now also requires SSE4.2, `CMPXCHG16B` and `SAHF`.\r\n- The AVX2 compatible architecture code path now also requires `BMI`, `BMI2`, `LZCNT`, `F16C`, `MOVBE`, `AES`, `PCLMUL`, `XSAVE`, `XRSTOR` and `XSAVEOPT`.\r\n- Added detection of the loong64 architecture to `CMakeLists.txt`.\r\n- Fixed potential compiler errors on the loong64, ppc64el, s390x, ppc64 and sparc64 architectures.\r\n- Added the `countdistinct` workflow to count distinct sequences in a FASTA file.\r\n- Added the option `--no-reorder` to disable reordering of alignment output according to the order of queries in the input file.\r\n- Added the option `--no-mempool` to disable per-thread memory pools."
